WEBVTT

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:08.699
Hello, my name is Zoey Stone. My pronouns are she/her,

00:00:08.699 --> 00:00:11.590
and I am a born and raised proud Knoxvillian.

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:13.902
My name is Casey Stone. My pronouns are

00:00:13.902 --> 00:00:16.570
they/them, and I've lived here over a decade.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:19.120
And we are the proud owners of Stone’s Throw

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.670
Coffee. We want to personally thank each and

00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:24.050
every one of you who have contributed in any

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:26.430
way to getting Stone’s Throw off the ground.

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:28.790
Because of your support and our grind, pun

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:31.430
intended, we've been able to take Stone’s Throw

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:34.282
Coffee from a theoretical conversation to an

00:00:34.282 --> 00:00:37.070
eight month project that's almost finished.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.128
We've been working hard nonstop behind the

00:00:39.128 --> 00:00:41.430
scenes to build a space different than anything

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.270
Knoxville has had before.

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:45.830
We've created a dark academia style coffee

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:48.390
shop with thoughtfully selected menu items

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:50.542
and intentional inclusion that

00:00:50.542 --> 00:00:52.910
goes beyond all are welcome here.

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:55.710
Our staff will be trained in taking orders in

00:00:55.710 --> 00:00:58.510
Spanish, American Sign Language, and English.

00:00:58.510 --> 00:01:02.063
We have a room dedicated to mental decompression.

00:01:02.063 --> 00:01:05.470
Rotating local artwork will be sold year-round.

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:07.536
This is proudly a safe space that

00:01:07.536 --> 00:01:09.790
just as proudly stands against hate.

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:11.751
We know that times are tough and

00:01:11.751 --> 00:01:13.590
budgets are tighter than ever.

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:15.215
We hope to build something that

00:01:15.215 --> 00:01:16.630
will last beyond right now.

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:18.610
At this point, we're continuing to ask for

00:01:18.610 --> 00:01:20.590
contributions within your means to push us

00:01:20.590 --> 00:01:22.510
through opening day.

00:01:22.510 --> 00:01:24.906
With your help, we'll be able to establish that

00:01:24.906 --> 00:01:27.150
long-term space that the Knoxville community

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:29.310
and the surrounding areas deserve.

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:31.535
As we said in the beginning, my spouse and I

00:01:31.535 --> 00:01:33.710
have grown lasting roots in this community.

00:01:33.710 --> 00:01:36.704
You sharing this video will help our community-centered

00:01:36.704 --> 00:01:38.990
coffee shop spread roots through Knoxville

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:40.830
and the surrounding areas, and we cannot

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:42.670
wait to see you at Stone’s Throw Coffee.

